  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPU, the world organisation of parliaments, is a global forum for     parliamnetary dialogue, cooperation and action. It advances democracy and assists parliaments (MP and staff) throughout the world to fulfil their mandates. A wast part of IPU*s work relates to so called        Technical Assistance to parliaments. In short IPU stands for: better  parliamnets, stronger democracies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IPU, v&#xe4;rldens organisation f&#xf6;r parliament. Man &#xe4;e ett globalt forum   f&#xf6;r parlamentarisk dialog, samarbete och aktion. man bidrar till att  utveckla demokratin genom att assistera parlament (s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l ledam&#xf6;ter    som personal) &#xf6;verallt i v&#xe4;rlden, f&#xf6;r att dessa p&#xe5; b&#xe4;sta s&#xe4;tt skall   uppfylla sina mandat. En stor del av st&#xf6;det handlar om tekniskt st&#xf6;d  till parlament. I korthet st&#xe5;r IPU f&#xf6;r: b&#xe4;ttre parlament, starkare de</narrative>
